(iii) $CO_{2(g)} + H_{2(g)} = CO_{(g)} + H_{2} O_{(l)}$,  $\Delta$H = $- X_{3}$ kJ mol^{ - 1}

(iv) $C_{2} H_{2(g)}$ + 5/$2O_{2(g)} = 2CO_{2(g)} + H_{2} O_{(l)}$,    $\Delta$H = +$X_{4}$ kJ mol^{ - 1}

Enthalpy of formation of $H_{2} O_{(l)}$ is

